    description: Some("A first-person hunt through the mazes of the Labyrinths of War. You pick the strong Valiant or the fast Sirius battlesuit, then track down and destroy a set number of enemy robots on each level with punches and charged missiles before your energy runs out, reading the 2-D map and radar to find them. Two players can duel over the link cable."),
